  "question": {
    "text": "The figure shows a system of three concentric metal shells A, B and C with radii a, 2a and 3a respectively. Shell B is earthed and shell C is given a charge Q. Now if shell C is connected to shell A, then the final charge on the shell B is&nbsp;<math><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>11</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo></mrow></semantics></math>&nbsp;find the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>.\r\r<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\r<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/woqghjofxkiurevcjcrdgkwdudftkyopoiywnxuvgnmggienty.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"height: 154px; width: 160px;\" /></p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>From given conditions, <math><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">and</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">  </mtext><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">     </mtext><mo accent=\"false\">⇒</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math></p><p><math><semantics><mrow><mo accent=\"false\">⇒</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mn>2</mn><mi>Q</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> ……(1)</p><p>Using <math><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi></msub></mrow></semantics></math> ; <math><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo form=\"prefix\" stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo form=\"postfix\" stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">  </mtext><mo accent=\"false\">⇒</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">  </mtext><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> …….(2)</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/wvawkkdghlpjktrebgeuqikisyztkyblxrkegrdbpsemwpypxn.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"height: 165px; width: 180px;\" /></p><p>Using it in (1), <math><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac><mi>Q</mi></mrow></semantics></math></p>",
